        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, computer, laptop, work at home, certified electricity mix</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, computer, laptop, work at home, certified electricity mix
The data set represents the use of a laptop computer during work at home.;
Synonyms: Heimarbeit; 
UUID: a3bac30d-0a94-39f4-8349-3ca3878848a4
This data set includes the use of a laptop and the energy consumption for working at home. It includes the laptop production, transport from plant to customer and electricity consumption (from certified electricity) for average office work.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Work at home using an average laptop computer with 68% active mode, 25%standby mode and 6% off mode
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a3bac30d-0a94-39f4-8349-3ca3878848a4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
